## User

Combine three lists element by element with a function, stopping at the shortest list.

## Type

type
```haskell
zipThree :: (a -> b -> c -> d) -> [a] -> [b] -> [c] -> [d]
```

## Term

```haskell
zipThree f xs ys zs = f xs ys zs
```

